# The steps tests/extera.env's run takes (mac-host --script): seconds from the start, then the step. Coordinates are in the
# 1080x2400 frame, with an iPhone's insets (HOST_ARGS). With the HUSK_BOT_TOKEN secret the app logs in to that bot's account by
# itself, on its first start (tests/plugins/husk_bot_login.plugin), and shows it from the next. Its chats: the first two opened.
8 shot intro
12 shot main
13 tap 540 470
20 shot chat1
21 swipe 540 900 540 1900
24 shot chat1-older
26 back
29 shot list
30 tap 540 690
37 shot chat2
38 swipe 540 900 540 1900
41 shot chat2-older
43 back
44 shot end
